		{
			description: [
				"&cHealth doesn't regenerate.&r Only &emedicine&r heals."
				""
				"&cEvery 4th night&r of your play time, at midnight, a horde comes for you. &cThe first is tonight.&r Light won't stop it. &aWalls will.&r"
				""
				"Final bosses and the &eBestiary&r raise your max health for good. Each death costs &c5%&r of what you've earned, never below half; &eBlood Packs&r give it back."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An &eAmmo Box&r holds one round type. &aRight-click rounds&r with it to fill it, an &aempty slot&r to take rounds out."
				""
				"A &eNutritional Liquifier&r turns any food into paste for a &eCanteen&r."
				""
				"A destroyed vehicle &ckills everyone aboard&r. Helicopters take damage landing faster than &e8 m/s&r."
